WEBVTT

00:02:59.668 --> 00:03:04.693
Trade is the answer to give dignity back
to millions of unprivileged people.

00:03:05.706 --> 00:03:09.155
Trade is a humanitarian's
strongest weapon.

00:03:10.046 --> 00:03:14.212
I work for a company
that facilitates trade in 220 countries,

00:03:14.917 --> 00:03:18.060
and I've personally assisted
trade in 46 of them.

00:03:18.766 --> 00:03:20.710
I've seen trade in action.

00:03:21.065 --> 00:03:22.575
I see trade work.

00:03:23.412 --> 00:03:26.027
But you don't have to take my word for it:

00:03:26.051 --> 00:03:28.654
economists have been
studying it for years.

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:31.910
In his book "The World Is Flat,"